[
  {
    "id": "c1",
    "startMs": 35960,
    "endMs": 39180,
    "text": "1. Listen and judge the pictures."
  },
  {
    "id": "c2",
    "startMs": 53230,
    "endMs": 57580,
    "text": "1. The boy is flying a kite in the park."
  },
  {
    "id": "c3",
    "startMs": 59320,
    "endMs": 63740,
    "text": "Two. The girl is reading a book under the tree."
  },
  {
    "id": "c4",
    "startMs": 65940,
    "endMs": 66540,
    "text": "Three."
  },
  {
    "id": "c5",
    "startMs": 67580,
    "endMs": 68380,
    "text": "It's cold outside,"
  },
  {
    "id": "c6",
    "startMs": 69200,
    "endMs": 71240,
    "text": "but the boy is still playing with snow."
  },
  {
    "id": "c7",
    "startMs": 73500,
    "endMs": 74200,
    "text": "Four."
  },
  {
    "id": "c8",
    "startMs": 75460,
    "endMs": 77720,
    "text": "The man is driving a bus to school."
  },
  {
    "id": "c9",
    "startMs": 80020,
    "endMs": 80820,
    "text": "Five."
  },
  {
    "id": "c10",
    "startMs": 81900,
    "endMs": 83900,
    "text": "The cat is sleeping on the sofa."
  },
  {
    "id": "c11",
    "startMs": 84960,
    "endMs": 90380,
    "text": "6. There are three goldfish in the tank."
  },
  {
    "id": "c12",
    "startMs": 91940,
    "endMs": 96540,
    "text": "7. The students are watching a science experiment."
  },
  {
    "id": "c13",
    "startMs": 98770,
    "endMs": 101840,
    "text": "8. I'm not feeling well."
  },
  {
    "id": "c14",
    "startMs": 102720,
    "endMs": 103770,
    "text": "I have an earache."
  },
  {
    "id": "c15",
    "startMs": 105610,
    "endMs": 110840,
    "text": "9. The girl is wearing a coat and holding an umbrella."
  },
  {
    "id": "c16",
    "startMs": 112500,
    "endMs": 116140,
    "text": "10. The family are eating breakfast."
  },
  {
    "id": "c17",
    "startMs": 121560,
    "endMs": 124200,
    "text": "题组二。One."
  },
  {
    "id": "c18",
    "startMs": 124270,
    "endMs": 127360,
    "text": "1. Would you prefer some coffee?"
  },
  {
    "id": "c19",
    "startMs": 130010,
    "endMs": 132120,
    "text": "2. In summer,"
  },
  {
    "id": "c20",
    "startMs": 132920,
    "endMs": 135700,
    "text": "I enjoy collecting seashells by the beach."
  },
  {
    "id": "c21",
    "startMs": 137910,
    "endMs": 141880,
    "text": "3. This ice cream is really delicious."
  },
  {
    "id": "c22",
    "startMs": 143890,
    "endMs": 148700,
    "text": "4. Spring brings green colour to the grass."
  },
  {
    "id": "c23",
    "startMs": 151510,
    "endMs": 154300,
    "text": "5. Can you find the ruler?"
  },
  {
    "id": "c24",
    "startMs": 155040,
    "endMs": 155940,
    "text": "It's in the desk."
  },
  {
    "id": "c25",
    "startMs": 158830,
    "endMs": 162840,
    "text": "6. The toys are placed on the bookshelf."
  },
  {
    "id": "c26",
    "startMs": 164960,
    "endMs": 169560,
    "text": "7. A monkey is eating a peach in the tree."
  },
  {
    "id": "c27",
    "startMs": 171640,
    "endMs": 173620,
    "text": "8. Hey, Kitty,"
  },
  {
    "id": "c28",
    "startMs": 174520,
    "endMs": 175920,
    "text": "how about playing hide and seek?"
  },
  {
    "id": "c29",
    "startMs": 176540,
    "endMs": 177080,
    "text": "Sounds fun."
  },
  {
    "id": "c30",
    "startMs": 179650,
    "endMs": 183640,
    "text": "9. The strong wind broke the window."
  },
  {
    "id": "c31",
    "startMs": 185480,
    "endMs": 190760,
    "text": "10. A magnifier helps you see small things clearly."
  },
  {
    "id": "c32",
    "startMs": 193240,
    "endMs": 198300,
    "text": "题组三。One."
  },
  {
    "id": "c33",
    "startMs": 198500,
    "endMs": 202240,
    "text": "School rules require uniforms from Monday through Friday."
  },
  {
    "id": "c34",
    "startMs": 205000,
    "endMs": 207480,
    "text": "2. During the Dragon Boat Festival,"
  },
  {
    "id": "c35",
    "startMs": 208260,
    "endMs": 210360,
    "text": "it's traditional to eat zongzi."
  },
  {
    "id": "c36",
    "startMs": 212960,
    "endMs": 217440,
    "text": "3. Toothpaste can help you keep your teeth clean and healthy."
  },
  {
    "id": "c37",
    "startMs": 219960,
    "endMs": 220700,
    "text": "Four."
  },
  {
    "id": "c38",
    "startMs": 221340,
    "endMs": 224740,
    "text": "A rabbit uses its tail to signal danger to others."
  },
  {
    "id": "c39",
    "startMs": 226880,
    "endMs": 227580,
    "text": "Five."
  },
  {
    "id": "c40",
    "startMs": 228780,
    "endMs": 229360,
    "text": "In the end,"
  },
  {
    "id": "c41",
    "startMs": 229820,
    "endMs": 232360,
    "text": "the ugly duckling turns into a lovely swan."
  },
  {
    "id": "c42",
    "startMs": 234740,
    "endMs": 239280,
    "text": "Six. We should get some fruit before anything else."
  },
  {
    "id": "c43",
    "startMs": 241660,
    "endMs": 242360,
    "text": "Seven."
  },
  {
    "id": "c44",
    "startMs": 243740,
    "endMs": 244600,
    "text": "French fries are tasty,"
  },
  {
    "id": "c45",
    "startMs": 245500,
    "endMs": 246620,
    "text": "but they aren't healthy."
  },
  {
    "id": "c46",
    "startMs": 249360,
    "endMs": 251680,
    "text": "8. One day,"
  },
  {
    "id": "c47",
    "startMs": 252200,
    "endMs": 254640,
    "text": "this little tree will become very large."
  },
  {
    "id": "c48",
    "startMs": 256230,
    "endMs": 261780,
    "text": "9. My watch says it's 10:45 now."
  },
  {
    "id": "c49",
    "startMs": 263690,
    "endMs": 268640,
    "text": "10. Yao Ming is well known as a basketball star."
  }
]